              "value": "# Recruiter Screen: {{candidate.name}} for {{candidate.role}}\n\n**Date:** {{screen_date}}\n**Email:** {{candidate.email}}\n**LinkedIn:** {{candidate.linkedin_url}}\n**Resume:** {{candidate.resume_link}}\n**Recommendation:** {{recommendation}}{{#score}} ({{score}}/100){{/score}}\n\n## Summary\n\n{{summary}}\n\n## Standard screen questions\n\n{{#standard_answers}}\n### {{question}}\n\n{{answer}}\n\n{{#evidence}}_Evidence: {{evidence}}_{{/evidence}}\n_Confidence: {{confidence}}_\n\n{{/standard_answers}}\n\n## Strengths\n\n{{#strengths}}\n- {{.}}\n{{/strengths}}\n\n## Concerns\n\n{{#concerns}}\n- {{.}}\n{{/concerns}}\n\n## Follow-up questions for the next round\n\n{{#follow_up_questions}}\n- {{.}}\n{{/follow_up_questions}}\n\n## Next steps\n\n{{next_steps}}\n\n---\n_Generated by Screen Scribe. See docs/CUSTOMIZE.md to change sections or wording._\n",
